  "Review international references": "Kambisisa swihlovo swa matiko",
  "International foundation": "Masungulo ya matiko",
  "Compare country evidence, language drafts and fictional project examples.": "Pimanisa vumbhoni bya matiko, mipfapfarhuto ya tindzimi ni swikombiso swa tiphurojeke leswi nga riki swa xiviri.",
  // Nursery: docs/audits/2026-11-01/nursery-release-drafts.json; unreviewed.
  "Plan seedlings, trays and nursery space with your own equipment and estimates.": "Kunguhata swimilana, tithireyi ni ndhawu ya nesari hi kungu ra wena ra swibyariwa u tirhisa switirhisiwa ni minkanyeto ya wena.",
  "Check nursery space": "Kambisisa ndhawu ya nesari",
  "Crop planner → Nursery planner": "Mukungu wa swibyariwa → Mukungu wa nesari",
  "Add your tray sizes, usable nursery surface and crop estimates. Review overlapping demand and missing information before adding automatic sowings.": "Nghenisa tisayizi ta tithireyi, ndhawu ya nesari leyi tirhisiwaka ni minkanyeto ya swibyariwa. Kambisisa swilaveko leswi hlanganaka ni vuxokoxoko lowu kayivelaka u nga si engetela ku byala loku kunguhatiwaka hi app.",

  // Sales-unit targets: docs/audits/2026-11-01/market-garden-sales-release-drafts.json; unreviewed.
  "Plan harvest targets in produce packs with your own pack weights and saleable share.": "Kunguhata swikongomelo swa ntshovelo hi tiphakiti ta swikumiwa u tirhisa mintiko ya tiphakiti ni xiphemu lexi xavisekaka lexi u xi ngheniseke.",

  // Harvest targets: docs/audits/2026-11-01/harvest-target-release-drafts.json; unreviewed.
  "Set weekly harvest targets and review growing space, dated sowings and gaps.": "Veka swikongomelo swa ntshovelo wa vhiki na vhiki kutani u kambisisa ndhawu yo byala, masiku yo byala ni swikhala.",
  "Plan from a harvest target": "Kunguhata hi xikongomelo xa ntshovelo",
  "Crop planner → Harvest targets": "Mukungu wa swibyariwa → Swikongomelo swa ntshovelo",
  "Choose a crop, weekly weight and harvest months. Review the proposal before adding its dated sowings to your crop plan.": "Hlawula xibyariwa, ntiko wa vhiki na vhiki ni tin’hweti ta ntshovelo. Kambisisa xiringanyeto u nga si engetela masiku ya xona yo byala eka kungu ra wena ra swibyariwa.",

  // Live render review: docs/audits/2026-10-31/live-map-settings-release-drafts.json; unreviewed.
  "Earthworks starts with your available aerial photo; plain paper remains a choice.": "Mintirho ya misava yi sungula hi xifaniso xa ndhawu lexi tekiweke ehenhla lexi nga kona; phepha ro basa ra ha ri ndlela yo hlawula.",
  // Map defaults: docs/audits/2026-10-31/map-defaults-release-drafts.json; unreviewed.
  "Each map opens with recommended settings and keeps your choices as you switch sheets.": "Mepe wun’wana ni wun’wana wu pfuleka hi swiyimiso leswi bumabumeriwaka naswona wu hlayisa leswi u swi hlawuleke loko u cinca maphepha.",
  "Check each map’s settings": "Kambela swiyimiso swa mepe wun’wana ni wun’wana",
  "Open Glossy and choose a sheet. Adjust its style, background or labels; your choices stay selected when you switch maps and return.": "Pfula Glossy u hlawula phepha. Cinca xitayele, le ndzhaku kumbe malebulu; leswi u swi hlawuleke swi sala swi hlawuriwile loko u cinca mimepe u tlhela u vuya.",

  // Sheet fidelity: docs/audits/2026-10-31/ai-sheet-fidelity-release-drafts.json; unreviewed.
  "AI map guidance separates earthworks from finished planting.": "Swiletelo swa mimepe ya AI swi hambanisa mintirho ya misava ni ku byala loku hetisisiweke.",
  // Field blocks: docs/audits/2026-10-31/field-block-release-drafts.json; unreviewed.
  "Draw named field blocks and fill them with beds using your own dimensions and path widths.": "Dirowa swiphemu swa nsimu leswi nga ni mavito kutani u swi tata hi mibedo u tirhisa mipimo ya wena ni ku anama ka tindlela.",
  "Keep a field open without beds and use both layouts in automatic crop planning.": "Siya xiphemu xa nsimu xi pfulekile xi nga ri na mibedo, kutani u tirhisa malulamiselo hamambirhi eka ku kunguhata swibyariwa loku tiendlekelaka.",
  "Lay out your fields": "Hlela masimu ya wena",
  "Site design → Planting → Field blocks": "Dizayini ya ndhawu → Ku byala → Swiphemu swa nsimu",
  "Draw a polygon, choose beds or open field, save the layout and open the automatic crop planner.": "Dirowa xivumbeko lexi nga ni tikhona, hlawula mibedo kumbe nsimu leyi pfulekeke, hlayisa malulamiselo kutani u pfula xipulani xa swibyariwa lexi tiendlekelaka.",
  // Paper recovery: docs/audits/2026-10-31/paper-map-release-drafts.json; unreviewed.
  "Style choices stay visible; plain-paper Water maps keep white backgrounds.": "Swihlawuriwa swa xitayele swi sala swi vonaka; mimepe ya Mati eka phepha ro basa yi hlayisa le ndzhaku ku basile.",
  // Oblique picker: docs/audits/2026-10-30/oblique-style-picker-release-drafts.json; unreviewed.
